WEBVTT

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:16.040
Let's go! Together, we will grasp that star.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.250
Starlight...

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.040
It's the story of goddesses drawn
by the glow of the heavens.

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:34.910
But they are pulled from one another,
never to meet again. It is a sad story.

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:49.290
Our dream will not come to be...

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:54.310
99th Seisho Festival

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:57.310
Seisho Grand Theater

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:21.220
Revue Starlight

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:30.000
Ano hoshi o tsukamu no wa daare?
Who, oh who, will be the one to grab hold of the star?

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:36.950
Tou no choujou de
At the very top of that tower

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:51.370
Shizuka ni tomotta honou ga atsuku mune o kogashite iku
These flames lit in silence fill my chest with a white-hot passion

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:53.620
Unmei no wa
That's just the Wheel of Fortune

00:01:53.620 --> 00:02:01.290
Butai no ue de odorasareteiru wake ja nai
It's not like I'm being forced to dance on this stage

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:03.500
Tobitate
Spring forth

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:07.370
Tashika ni ano hi mitanda
I'm sure I saw it that day

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:11.000
Hajiketa hoshi no kirameki
The brilliance of a star that has burst open

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:17.450
Iroaseta yakusoku ni yubi ga fureru made
Until my fingers reach out to touch that faded promise

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.540
Makuake mae ni hajimaru
It will start before the curtain rises

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:25.080
Me no mae de tsuzurareteku
And be spelled out before our eyes

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:28.700
Umarekawatta watashi wa
Having been reborn

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:32.540
Koko de kimi ni aeta
I was able to meet you here

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:36.160
Mou ichido
Once again

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:46.700
Hikari-chan, you said you don't like wobbly things, so...

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:50.000
I baked some delicious banana muffins!

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:51.790
Let's eat together today.

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:55.410
We... we did it!

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:57.620
You two barely made it on time, huh?

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:04.120
A-awful... Waking Karen-chan up today was just awful!

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:06.620
I did this...

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:09.290
and I did that...

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.250
and I even went THAT far...

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.040
But she wouldn't wake up at all!

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:18.950
Well, a lot of stuff happened yesterday...

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:20.120
"A lot"?

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:21.750
Enough's enough.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.410
You need to start waking up on your own.

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:27.870
At this rate, you're just being
a nuisance to Tsuyuzaki, right?

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:33.950
I-it's not like I hate waking up Karen-chan or anything...

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:34.250
Morning, Jun-jun!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:38.500
Said like a true early bird!
I'd expect nothing less from the class rep!

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:42.450
You're the only one who's still late even
after becoming a second-year, Karen.

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:46.540
That's because I was dead tired yesterday!

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:49.370
I was worn out too, but I still got up.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.950
Karen-chan... What's with "Jun-jun"?

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.040
No comment!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.410
Junna-chan, did something happen
between you and Karen-chan?

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:00.700
No comment.

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:04.660
Homeroom is starting.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:05.750
Oh...

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:08.120
Let's eat lunch together for sure today, okay?

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.620
Is Saijo out today?

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:13.160
Huh? Claudine-chan is out today?

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:15.160
I wonder what happened...

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:20.120
Uh, we've received a proposal for next year's
Seisho Festival from Group B.

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:22.450
Please make sure you all read it thoroughly.

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:24.370
Here!

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:27.080
Kagura, this will be your first Seisho Festival, right?

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:29.830
Proposal - 100th Seisho Festival

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:31.450
It's a performance that all the students
put on for the parents...

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:34.160
I guess it's sort of like a culture festival.

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:36.120
Proposal - 100th Seisho Festival

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.580
Be careful carrying that!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:40.580
We in the 99th class are going to do "Starlight"
for all of our three years here.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:45.620
And each year, we're going
to steadily improve our performance!

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.290
I see...

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:54.370
Also, for our next Seisho Festival, it's been decided
that Daiba will also work behind the scenes.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:59.620
Together with Group B, she'll be studying
scriptwriting and stage production.

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:03.160
Banana?

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:06.580
I really do love singing and dancing...

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:13.700
But I've also gained an interest in things like
production, scriptwriting, and stage setting.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:17.450
So, you're not going to be on stage anymore, Banana?

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:20.830
That depends on the script, I guess.

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:25.200
Of course, if it's a small part, I'll probably do it.

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:33.410
But that's a waste of your talent!

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:36.790
Banana-chan, you're so good at singing and dancing...

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:43.790
It's precisely because she knows what it's like
to be onstage that she should be able to write for it.

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:46.120
Maya-chan...

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:48.660
I look forward to a good production...

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.500
One that uses all of us to the fullest.

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:53.910
Thank you.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:59.830
I'll be sure we put on the ultimate performance,
just like our last "Starlight."

00:05:56.900 --> 00:06:00.410
99th
Seisho Festival

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:13.040
Best of luck, Banana-han!
I look forward to seeing your work.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.410
Thanks, Kaoruko-chan!

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:16.700
And so...

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:23.330
in hopes that this time, for sure, you get the lead role...

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.330
Here's a good-luck candy!

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:24.450
What?!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.330
Come on now, Kaoruko!

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:27.410
Have some candy.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:30.700
Bribery is bad, you know. And that's bribery.

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:30.700
Here ya go!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.080
That goes for you too!

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:37.660
Nana, give the audition your all, okay?

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:40.540
I definitely want to show everyone
that I can get the lead role!

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:43.250
Jun-jun, be aggressive!

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:44.750
Okay, me too!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:52.330
U-um, if you get the lead role, Karen-chan,
then... well, if I could be the supporting role, then-!

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:53.120
Bonjour.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:56.750
Ah! Claudine-chan!

00:06:56.750 --> 00:07:00.500
Oh, my. I, of all people, unfortunately overslept.

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:05.040
Hm? The Seisho Festival?
It's almost time for it to begin, isn't it?

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:09.950
Claudine-chan, listen! For the next Seisho Festival,
Banana will be working behind the scenes!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.620
Oh, is that so?

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:17.000
Ah. So that's why all of you were trying to bribe Banana?

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:20.870
Goodness. "Bribe" is such a tasteless word...

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.450
Fine, then allow me to contribute...

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:24.120
Care for some macarons verdant?

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:28.500
Wait, you played the main role last year,
so you can't do it again!

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.660
Huh?

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:32.160
Okay, okay. I get it.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:34.410
Good morning.

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:40.000
Morning.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:13.670
Actor Training
Department

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:15.670
The Embodiment of a Star

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:22.920
Kaoruko
Kaoruko
Kaoruko

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:31.200
Huh?

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.580
I guess Karen-chan went home before me...

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:40.580
Huh?

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.040
Hikari-chan!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.620
Hm? What?!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:49.410
W-wait a minute! What is this?!

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:53.450
Hey, c'mon, Hikari-chan! Hika-

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:57.540
Hikari-chan! Hika-

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:04.450
Wait, wait! Hikari-chan, why are you
locking me in here? Did I do something wrong?

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:07.120
Or maybe you're angry? Hikari-chan!

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:10.290
I-I don't know, but it's already dark and it's time to eat!

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:13.330
In any case, let's just calm down
and talk things over, okay?

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:15.500
Okay?

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:25.620
Hikari-chan! Wait! I can't eat like this!

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:28.750
Series
Jirou Uma
Confidential Files
Animals of the World
(9) - Giraffes
The top-secret,
hidden ecology of unconfirmed life

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:35.120
You're making a scary face.

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:36.290
Huh?

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:39.040
Here you go!

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:41.200
Oh, thanks.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.120
Have you made any progress on what you're looking up?

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:47.910
Not really. I mean, I'm not even sure
what I should be looking up...

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:52.910
How's the script coming along?

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:55.700
I've still just barely started.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:10:01.160
The first step is to read a lot, write a lot,
and just learn and learn!

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:05.660
Good luck, Banana
from Karen

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:05.700
I have to do my best... For everyone else's sake as well.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:08.410
Yeah.

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:26.580
Watch the floor.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:29.910
You'll get hurt if you don't wipe it properly, Claudine-ko.

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:32.950
Futaba?

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:39.000
She's not in her room...

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.790
Or in the living room.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.330
Karen-chan?

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.910
She's not in here, either.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.080
I see. Sorry to intrude.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:54.910
Since you're already here,
how about you join me, Mahiru?

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:56.410
Huh?

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:01.950
I've been quite bored here... since Futaba left.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:06.200
Why...?

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:11.160
Did something happen between you and Tendo?

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:12.080
Huh?

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:18.660
That's the only thing that could make you act strange.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.250
She's your "rival," right?

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:31.450
Hm?

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:34.410
H-hey!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.080
Well, I just wanted to teach her a lesson!

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:41.330
Isn't that a bit cowardly, Miss "Talented Child Actress"?!

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:43.750
Now that I've grown up, I'm just a regular person!

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:49.200
I'm the only one who's different.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:53.250
That's what I came to think. And yet...

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:01.410
I couldn't reach it.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:14.000
M-merci.

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:17.040
Honestly... This is unbelievable.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:22.330
How could Futaba leave me all alone for so long?

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:28.160
Mahiru-han, you've been abandoned as well, right?
By Karen-han, that is.

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:31.500
"Abandoned"?! I don't really think...

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:37.290
Even though you say, "Karen-chan, I love you!"
in your sleep every night?

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.160
Oh? So you really DO say that?

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.000
Stop messing around!

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:45.910
I am just messing around... of course.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.620
An unexpected friendship between two girls in a bath,

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:52.370
formed when the someone important is suddenly gone...

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.540
It's strange, don't you think?

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:58.660
Hikari Kagura... Ever since she came here...

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:05.500
How surprising. Futaba, I thought you
only had eyes for Kaoruko.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:10.790
I do like her, and I'm grateful to her.

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:14.120
I have to look after her till she can take care of herself.

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.160
That's what I thought, at least.

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:21.870
But, I think I can do it.

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:26.910
I figured I'd always be playing secondary roles,
but I think I can...

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:30.410
Be the Top Star?

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:34.910
Bath

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:44.160
Audition
Day 3

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:47.670
Notice:
Hikari Kagura
Today
Day off

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:49.160
Okay!

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:53.700
Quietly, quietly... Tiptoe, tiptoe, and...

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.040
Karen!

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.080
You can't! Karen!

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:06.910
I have to go!

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:10.870
And I'm going to win!

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:25.910
99th
Seisho Festival

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:44.660
I'm not losing.

00:14:56.070 --> 00:15:02.330
I AM                                      REBORN

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:04.250
No. 99 Trolley Furnace

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.120
No. 99 Trolley Furnace

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.050
Sewing Process

00:15:46.950 --> 00:15:49.000
Atop a stage brimming with stardust,

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:51.620
in the flowers of love that
have so magnificently bloomed...

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.450
Student of the 99th class,

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:54.580
Karen Aijo!

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:59.000
We will all do Starlight!

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:05.370
The star of love which shines on the moon...

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:12.120
Now, gather that outpouring of light
and send it to your heart!

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:16.540
Head of the 99th class, Maya Tendo!

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:20.080
Tonight, I will show you the sparkle!

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.370
Tendo-san.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:49.580
And so... the third day of auditions,
the Revue of Pride, will now commence.

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:03.040
I should be able to see it as well

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:08.910
No, you won't see it

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:18.160
The view at the top of that tower

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:25.040
What is in your heart?

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:29.790
That which the blinking eye takes in

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:34.910
Even the star that has yet to arrive

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:38.620
If it is for the sake of that promise

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:44.620
Will continue to streak forth

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:46.950
Karen Aijo, why are you in this revue?

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:50.950
What do you mean, "Why?" So I can be a star!

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:54.450
Together with Hikari-chan!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.330
"Together"?

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:03.700
"If you catch a small star, you've obtained
a small bit of happiness."

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:09.200
"If you catch a large star,
you've obtained a large fortune."

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:12.250
Is that line from... Starlight?!

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:14.620
But in exchange...

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:21.250
What have you given up?

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:39.830
The call of a goddess and the celestial throne

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:50.200
Yes, there is only one star that drifts down

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:06.200
You can't... Karen!

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:13.700
Pride and
Arrogance
Revue of Pride

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:15.500
Come climb up, if you have the guts

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:19.910
Try to slay me, show me your rage

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:24.580
Don't be swayed by the great beast taking residence in your mind

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:33.330
I care nothing for those who lack resolve

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:44.120
I want to see that gaze, a fight with pride on the line

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:39.370
On the stage, there is but one star.

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:44.450
Seek for it, hunger for it... Thirst for it, fight for it.

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.160
I sacrificed that girl...

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.040
I discarded her.

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:02.870
That is the challenge of the star, a noble intention...

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:07.620
Yes. And that is precisely why I will...

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:08.540
Karen!

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:14.250
Going higher and shining more

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:18.660
Illuminating the horizon

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:24.500
One step forward, one step closer to the dream

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:27.870
That is pride

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:32.450
Going higher and shining more

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:37.250
Toward an unreachable place

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:44.330
That is my pride

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:40.700
Top Star...

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:47.200
I can't even come close!

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:00.620
I'm not losing!

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:03.750
I am a star, even on my own!

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.700
Position Zero.

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:17.000
This is Tendo Maya!

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:24.910
There is but one star that shines above all.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:42.120
And yet, the flames of that girl's passion are...

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:59.040
I've watched you for so long

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:06.910
It seems you've set your loneliness aside

00:22:06.910 --> 00:22:10.540
On this night, even the moon

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:14.160
Grins

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:17.500
Look this way

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:22.790
Oh, fly me to the star

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:45.700
I can't tell you how I feel

00:22:45.700 --> 00:22:51.120
So many different lives

00:22:51.120 --> 00:22:53.120
That I call to mind

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:56.910
And try to act out

00:22:57.250 --> 00:23:00.830
Because it's your attention

00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:03.910
That I want to attract

00:23:03.910 --> 00:23:08.750
Oh, fly me to the star

00:23:24.410 --> 00:23:25.950
Hikari-chan...

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:27.910
I lost.

00:23:29.120 --> 00:23:32.540
Rather, I wasn't even a match for her.

00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:35.000
How can I put this...?

00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:37.950
I'm not sure. My head is spinning.

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:42.700
I should have been singing and dancing
with all my strength,

00:23:42.700 --> 00:23:46.120
but my body and my voice were just...

00:23:46.580 --> 00:23:48.450
Hikari-chan, I-

00:23:57.790 --> 00:23:58.750
Idiot!

00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:04.410
Next Time
Promise Tower

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:02.700
Revue Starlight!

00:24:02.700 --> 00:24:04.450
I understand. I understand.
